Okay, absolutely.

52
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.860
I know that something film in your family home

53
00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:30.930
when you were younger

54
00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:34.110
and it had a light bulb go off, will you tell me about that?

55
00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:36.010
My story is kind of beautiful.

56
00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.120
We were living on a small island in South Carolina

57
00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.203
and I'd never been around movies.

58
00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:45.820
I'd honestly never even seen a play

59
00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:47.863
at that point in my life.

60
00:02:47.863 --> 00:02:51.250
And this little island, for some reason

61
00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:54.330 line:15%
this little Canadian film company got snowed out

62
00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.650 line:15%
of where they were filming some scenes on a beach

63
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.120
and they needed a place that didn't have terrible weather

64
00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.020
in the middle of winter.

65
00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.880
And they came down and they rented the house

66
00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:05.860
that we were living in as a production office.

67
00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.930
And they filmed some scenes literally in front of the house

68
00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.100
and the sand dunes.

69
00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:14.200
And I was, I think, an eight, nine year old boy

70
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:18.890
and I snuck out and I literally covered myself in the weeds,

71
00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.610
the weeds that are in the sand.

72
00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:25.160
And I watched the scene like laying on the beach.

73
00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:28.240
I watched the scene between two teenage lovers

74
00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:33.040
and I remember just being, so, I mean, my heart was racing.

75
00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.750
I was scared of being caught

76
00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.270
and it was magical at a level

77
00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.100
that I don't know if I've ever even felt anything,

78
00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.430
making movies as much as I've sort of yearned

79
00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.393
for that first high, I guess.

80
00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:48.470
But I decided in that moment to be an actor.

81
00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.030
I love that story.

82
00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:55.030
It's great to find a sense of purpose in all of our lives.

83
00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.030
And I do think that people are finding a sense of purpose

84
00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.490
in ways that they did not know possible.

85
00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:02.910
And I see the evidence of it everywhere.

86
00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:06.760
And literally the show is here to talk about that.

87
00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.593
Well, that's what I'm gonna say.

88
00:04:07.593 --> 00:04:10.150
You must be feeling that, doing the show, right?

89
